From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Market Canopy <office@marketcanopy.invalid>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Register the Market Canopy account module

The account module (src/marketcanopy, added by the branding overlay)
fills the "additional" extension point and gets five one-line hooks:
start page "mc:" commands and its "portal:logout" of Market Canopy
(cefview.cpp on_exec_command), main frame loads for launch and the
connect page's web-session POST (OnLoadEnd), scheme links handed over by
the shells (CAscApplicationManager::CallCommand, and CCefView::load,
which never loads a sign-in callback or a link carrying a credential),
and window.AscDesktopEditor.getMarketCanopyAiSession() for the two AI
plugins in the system plugins folder only (P02 contract section 9; the
method is restricted, and any other caller gets undefined).
---
 ChromiumBasedEditors/lib/ascdocumentscore.pro |  3 +++
 .../lib/src/additional/create.cpp             |  6 ++++--
 .../lib/src/applicationmanager.cpp            |  4 +++-
 ChromiumBasedEditors/lib/src/cefview.cpp      | 11 ++++++++++
 .../cefwrapper/client_renderer_wrapper.cpp    | 21 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../lib/src/plugin_permissions.h              |  3 +++
 6 files changed, 44 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

